  "gear": "Topo Athletic MTN Racer v4",
  "description": "The approach trail was just so lovely and perfectly technical but still very runnable that I was enjoying myself too much and missed the turnoff to highbox. The summit trail kind of sucks it seems to totally disappear in places leading to a lot of uncomfortable bushwhacking. The final class 3 summit scramble made it worth it in the end though. Great views. So many more peaks to do and no more time. Testing the Topos I liked them for the flats not the steeps",
